WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.589
Two plastic films may look identical until

00:00:03.589 --> 00:00:06.379
something meets their surface. We changed the

00:00:06.379 --> 00:00:09.168
outermost layer of poly lactic acid, then

00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:10.762
tested how it behaved.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.761
Untreated PLA had a measured water contact

00:00:18.761 --> 00:00:21.723
angle of seventy point two degrees. In

00:00:21.723 --> 00:00:24.684
this experiment, that helped establish the reference

00:00:24.684 --> 00:00:25.953
surface for comparison.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.864
Cold plasma alters the film's contact surface.

00:00:33.864 --> 00:00:36.927
The next question is whether new surface

00:00:36.927 --> 00:00:39.991
chemistry can be introduced, rather than merely

00:00:39.991 --> 00:00:42.617
depositing molecules on an unprepared polymer.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:49.052
The study compared ascorbic acid with fumaric

00:00:49.052 --> 00:00:52.304
acid after plasma treatment. Their different surface

00:00:52.304 --> 00:00:55.557
responses became a test of what chemical

00:00:55.557 --> 00:00:57.415
modification had actually achieved.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:04.728
Contact angle alone cannot establish molecular attachment.

00:01:04.728 --> 00:01:08.655
The investigators also used X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy

00:01:08.655 --> 00:01:12.583
to compare surface chemistry after plasma exposure

00:01:12.583 --> 00:01:13.705
and grafting.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.642
The measured water contact angle fell from

00:01:18.642 --> 00:01:21.484
seventy point two degrees untreated to fifty

00:01:21.484 --> 00:01:24.327
five point one after plasma treatment, and

00:01:24.327 --> 00:01:27.169
forty nine point six after fumaric acid

00:01:27.169 --> 00:01:27.575
grafting.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.878
In the original peel test, the untreated

00:01:33.878 --> 00:01:36.957
laminate resisted separation at seventy four newtons

00:01:36.957 --> 00:01:40.035
per meter. Fumaric acid grafting after plasma

00:01:40.035 --> 00:01:42.234
treatment reached two hundred eleven.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.671
Adding fumaric acid without plasma gave only

00:01:48.671 --> 00:01:51.541
eighty seven newtons per meter. The strongest

00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:54.412
result required the treatment sequence. That is

00:01:54.412 --> 00:01:57.283
evidence for a surface process, not a

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:58.513
universal packaging claim.
